  "basic_info_description": "Light-filled 3 br/1.5ba Single Family Sunset District Home -- Open House-Sat. June 25 from 3-4pm - Three Bedroom + Large, finished Bonus Room \n\nClassic light-filled San Francisco charm with great floor plan\nNewly-refinished hardwood floors, new paint and new window coverings \nLots of closets and storage \nBright living room with fireplace (decorative)\nFormal dining room\nEat-in kitchen with new dishwasher and near-new gas stove and large refrigerator\nFull bath including separate shower and tub (with large skylight for natural light)\nMaster bedroom features additional half-bathroom\nLarge, newly-carpeted bonus room (23 x 13 ft) downstairs with window and generous closets\nAppliances include full-size washer, gas dryer (downstairs)\nLarge private yard  add/grow your own plants\nDeep garage with two car (tandem) capacity\nOff street parking in driveway\nNon-smoking tenants only\nRenter's insurance required \nPet negotiable \n\nLocated in Outer Sunset 5 blocks from Ocean Beach (at night you can hear the surf!). 2-1/2 blocks from trendy shops and eateries at Noriega/45th. Walk to West Sunset, South Sunset and Sunset Playgrounds and to the Ortega Branch Public Library. \n \n \nThis house is being shown by Gordon Property Management. Please call Nanette at 415-625-0992 with any questions.\n\n(RLNE2427780)",
